<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main id="main" class="section shell">
    <header class="section__head section__head--page">
      <p class="eyebrow">The rules</p>
      <h1 class="section__title">How scoring works</h1>
      <p class="section__lede">Every puzzle is worth a base score. What you do next moves it up or down.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="card-grid card-grid--2">
      <article class="panel">
        <h2 class="panel__title">Base points</h2>
        <p>Each puzzle carries a base value set by its author, roughly tracking its level:</p>
        <ul class="list">
          <li><span class="badge badge--easy">Easy</span> around 70-90 points</li>
          <li><span class="badge badge--medium">Medium</span> around 100-150 points</li>
          <li><span class="badge badge--hard">Hard</span> around 160-240 points</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="panel">
        <h2 class="panel__title">Penalties</h2>
        <p>Applied first, and the result never drops below zero.</p>
        <ul class="list">
          <li><strong>-15</strong> for every hint you reveal</li>
          <li><strong>-10</strong> for every wrong submission</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="muted">Hints and wrong guesses are counted on the server against your play session, so reloading the page will not reset them.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="panel">
        <h2 class="panel__title">Bonuses</h2>
        <p>Applied after penalties, so a heavily hinted solve can never out-earn a clean one.</p>
        <ul class="list">
          <li><strong>Speed bonus</strong> - up to 25% of base for solving inside 20 seconds, tapering to zero at two minutes.</li>
          <li><strong>Streak multiplier</strong> - +5% per consecutive day solved, capped at ×1.5.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="panel">
        <h2 class="panel__title">The formula</h2>
        <pre class="code-block"><code>earned = max(0, base - 15×hints - 10×wrong)
total  = round((earned + speedBonus) × streakMultiplier)</code></pre>
        <p class="muted">A puzzle already solved in the current session scores zero - load a new one to keep earning.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="panel">
        <h2 class="panel__title">Answer matching</h2>
        <p>Answers are graded generously. All of these are treated as the same answer:</p>
        <ul class="list">
          <li><code>Echo</code> · <code>an echo</code> · <code>ECHO!</code> · <code>écho</code></li>
          <li><code>8</code> · <code>eight</code></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="muted">Case, accents, punctuation, a leading "a/an/the" and spelled-out numbers are all normalised away before comparing.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="panel">
        <h2 class="panel__title">Daily streaks</h2>
        <p>Solve at least one puzzle each UTC day to extend your streak. Miss a day and it restarts at 1 - solving twice in one day holds it steady rather than doubling it.</p>
        <p class="panel__cta"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/play">Start solving</a></p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/js/ui.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
